<title>SPAIN: Spain's Fecsa 9-month profit fell to 10.96 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Fecsa 9-month profit fell to 10.96 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electric company Fecsa reported on Monday its nine-month net attributable profit fell to 10.96 billion pesetas from 11.673 billion in the same period last year.  </p>
<p>(billions pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax profit			  15.21     vs    14.34</p>
<p> Net taxed				10.96     vs    11.67</p>
<p> Turnover				178.58     vs   178.07</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name Fuerzas Electricas de Catalunya-Fecsa SA.</p>
</text>
